(5273675, 768079, 99263, '<td valign="top">I applaud you for thinking out of the box and presenting us with something that''s refreshingly different from most of the other entries in this challenge.  Also you executed it superbly from a both a technical and photographic viewpoint.<br/>Lovely model too by the way.<br/>Just the tiniest of niggles....nothing can ever be 100% perfect of course ;)...there''s a little patch of reeds on the far right of the picture just under the shoreline that I would have removed by cropping it out. I can see this entry finishing in the top three.  9</td>', 'I applaud you for thinking out of the box and presenting us with something that''s refreshingly different from most of the other entries in this challenge.  Also you executed it superbly from a both a technical and photographic viewpoint.Lovely model too by the way.Just the tiniest of niggles....nothing can ever be 100% perfect of course ;)...there''s a little patch of reeds on the far right of the picture just under the shoreline that I would have removed by cropping it out. I can see this entry finishing in the top three.  9', '2009-02-25 03:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
