(5273736, 768198, 60173, '<td valign="top">This is quite a powerful image, and a great idea for this challenge! <br/> <br/>I think this photo would be a good candidate for selective desaturation. I took a copy and played with it in Photoshop, and it looks really good with the desaturation and a contrast boost. I also dodged, burned, and sharpened the eyes a little more, and they look awesome.<br/> <br/>I saved a copy of my edit in my Workshop. I know you didn''t ask for an optional edit, so let me know if you want me to delete it.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=768306" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/60173/120/768306.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/60173/120/768306.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/60173/120/768306.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is quite a powerful image, and a great idea for this challenge!  I think this photo would be a good candidate for selective desaturation. I took a copy and played with it in Photoshop, and it looks really good with the desaturation and a contrast boost. I also dodged, burned, and sharpened the eyes a little more, and they look awesome. I saved a copy of my edit in my Workshop. I know you didn''t ask for an optional edit, so let me know if you want me to delete it. ', '2009-02-25 04:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
