(5274377, 767737, 88580, '<td valign="top">Very peculilar, indeed.  There''s just enough "stuff" here to make you want to try to figure out what''s going on.</td>', 'Very peculilar, indeed.  There''s just enough "stuff" here to make you want to try to figure out what''s going on.', '2009-02-25 12:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
