(5274381, 767770, 18655, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Nice shapes and good diagonal.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Nice shapes and good diagonal.', '2009-02-25 12:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274383, 767889, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great texture!</td>', 'Great texture!', '2009-02-25 12:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274385, 768264, 18655, '<td valign="top">Looks like a puzzle to me!</td>', 'Looks like a puzzle to me!', '2009-02-25 12:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274386, 767735, 18655, '<td valign="top">LOL - I can see how that can be puzzling for a teenager. What a luxury problem though! :) Nice shot.</td>', 'LOL - I can see how that can be puzzling for a teenager. What a luxury problem though! :) Nice shot.', '2009-02-25 12:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274387, 768114, 88580, '<td valign="top">Without the context of the challenge, I don''t think I would have thought of the ice as puzzle pieces.  That''s really what they look like, though.  The title got a chuckle from me, too.  I love the tones in the wall and rusted rings.</td>', 'Without the context of the challenge, I don''t think I would have thought of the ice as puzzle pieces.  That''s really what they look like, though.  The title got a chuckle from me, too.  I love the tones in the wall and rusted rings.', '2009-02-25 12:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274389, 768117, 18655, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge well for me. Nice lines - both parallel and diagonal.</td>', 'Fits the challenge well for me. Nice lines - both parallel and diagonal.', '2009-02-25 12:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274391, 767551, 18655, '<td valign="top">A few puzzling things here actually. Thought provoking too. Good job!</td>', 'A few puzzling things here actually. Thought provoking too. Good job!', '2009-02-25 12:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274393, 766631, 88580, '<td valign="top">The unusual pose the subject is in--as well has his expression--tells a great story.</td>', 'The unusual pose the subject is in--as well has his expression--tells a great story.', '2009-02-25 12:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274394, 768021, 18655, '<td valign="top">Could be puzzling I guess. Nice monkey and good pose but the blur from the fence where the lens was is a bit disturbing.</td>', 'Could be puzzling I guess. Nice monkey and good pose but the blur from the fence where the lens was is a bit disturbing.', '2009-02-25 12:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274399, 768225, 18655, '<td valign="top">Very cool reflection and fits the challenge well.</td>', 'Very cool reflection and fits the challenge well.', '2009-02-25 13:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274403, 768054, 18655, '<td valign="top">Excellent job. One of my favorites so far. Creative, tastefully edited and a suitable expression for the occasion. 8</td>', 'Excellent job. One of my favorites so far. Creative, tastefully edited and a suitable expression for the occasion. 8', '2009-02-25 13:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274406, 766795, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great idea. No doubt puzzling if that was real! :)</td>', 'Great idea. No doubt puzzling if that was real! :)', '2009-02-25 13:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274407, 768049, 89940, '<td valign="top">The focus is off on the whole photo. Lighting is also a little harsh.</td>', 'The focus is off on the whole photo. Lighting is also a little harsh.', '2009-02-25 13:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274410, 767359, 18655, '<td valign="top">Interesting and creative entry. Made me look twice.</td>', 'Interesting and creative entry. Made me look twice.', '2009-02-25 13:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274411, 767982, 89940, '<td valign="top">Very well executed.</td>', 'Very well executed.', '2009-02-25 13:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274412, 767475, 18655, '<td valign="top">Very thought provoking and something original. Looks good in b/w. May not be a picture that is attractive to the DPC masses but I like it a lot. 8</td>', 'Very thought provoking and something original. Looks good in b/w. May not be a picture that is attractive to the DPC masses but I like it a lot. 8', '2009-02-25 13:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274413, 768154, 100318, '<td valign="top">very creative - love the idea</td>', 'very creative - love the idea', '2009-02-25 13:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274414, 768221, 18655, '<td valign="top">Hehe - been there, done that. My kids also have a tent that I have crawled into. Definitely puzzling to the people that don''t know. Good job!</td>', 'Hehe - been there, done that. My kids also have a tent that I have crawled into. Definitely puzzling to the people that don''t know. Good job!', '2009-02-25 13:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274419, 768212, 101668, '<td valign="top">I love the idea!</td>', 'I love the idea!', '2009-02-25 13:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274420, 766604, 18655, '<td valign="top">I like the whole idea, composition, colors and everything else about this shot. Except... I think it would have been a little stronger without the ghosting of the model since it would then have been more real to me. But I do understand of course that the ''ghosting'' was done to make it puzzling. Great job either way! 8</td>', 'I like the whole idea, composition, colors and everything else about this shot. Except... I think it would have been a little stronger without the ghosting of the model since it would then have been more real to me. But I do understand of course that the ''ghosting'' was done to make it puzzling. Great job either way! 8', '2009-02-25 13:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274422, 768143, 18655, '<td valign="top">Very cook concept. The vivid colors look good and the clarity of the model is good. Good job lining up the dog face too. 7</td>', 'Very cook concept. The vivid colors look good and the clarity of the model is good. Good job lining up the dog face too. 7', '2009-02-25 13:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274424, 767453, 18655, '<td valign="top">What a heart breaker! She is just the cutest little thing and she DOES look puzzled to me. 7</td>', 'What a heart breaker! She is just the cutest little thing and she DOES look puzzled to me. 7', '2009-02-25 13:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274428, 768212, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Good use of shallow DOF and good lighting. Looks a little bland maybe... a colored background would maybe have spiced it up a little.</td>', 'Great idea. Good use of shallow DOF and good lighting. Looks a little bland maybe... a colored background would maybe have spiced it up a little.', '2009-02-25 13:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274429, 766947, 101668, '<td valign="top">Great one.</td>', 'Great one.', '2009-02-25 13:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274430, 768257, 101668, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea and shot.</td>', 'Brilliant idea and shot.', '2009-02-25 13:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274438, 768200, 18655, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite figure this one out. It''s a puzzle alright but I''m not sure if you have taken a picture of an object (a lamp maybe - or simply a spherical puzzle??) or if this is something you arranged. Good lighting though and a nice effect. 6</td>', 'I can''t quite figure this one out. It''s a puzzle alright but I''m not sure if you have taken a picture of an object (a lamp maybe - or simply a spherical puzzle??) or if this is something you arranged. Good lighting though and a nice effect. 6', '2009-02-25 13:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274439, 768134, 18655, '<td valign="top">Abstract to me that don''t know much about whatever this might be! :) Good colors though and indeed puzzling.</td>', 'Abstract to me that don''t know much about whatever this might be! :) Good colors though and indeed puzzling.', '2009-02-25 13:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274443, 766833, 18655, '<td valign="top">I get the point and the puzzling part but it''s just not a very attractive picture to me. It also seem to not be in focus.</td>', 'I get the point and the puzzling part but it''s just not a very attractive picture to me. It also seem to not be in focus.', '2009-02-25 13:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274447, 767989, 18655, '<td valign="top">A puzzle no doubt... I can''t see what''s on it but that''s probably done on purpose. The chrome effect is cool and the background is suitable. Not the best in the challenge but definitely interesting. 5</td>', 'A puzzle no doubt... I can''t see what''s on it but that''s probably done on purpose. The chrome effect is cool and the background is suitable. Not the best in the challenge but definitely interesting. 5', '2009-02-25 13:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274452, 767892, 18655, '<td valign="top">Is it just me, or does he have a little bug in his mouth??  That does indeed look cool. And I guess he does look a little puzzled.</td>', 'Is it just me, or does he have a little bug in his mouth??  That does indeed look cool. And I guess he does look a little puzzled.', '2009-02-25 13:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274456, 767091, 18655, '<td valign="top">lol - must be a Japanese game show OR a native American. Great colors and puzzling to me!</td>', 'lol - must be a Japanese game show OR a native American. Great colors and puzzling to me!', '2009-02-25 13:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274461, 767982, 18655, '<td valign="top">The set-up is obvious but the result is excellent! I love it! Suitable title. Thought provoking. 8</td>', 'The set-up is obvious but the result is excellent! I love it! Suitable title. Thought provoking. 8', '2009-02-25 13:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274462, 768242, 100495, '<td valign="top">It''s a very bright and colourful image that clearly meets the challenge so I can''t see people voting it down for that. Exposure and focus seem fine, white balance seems spot on. The strong shadows might put some people off.<br/> <br/>The composition feels a little ''tense'', possibly because of the tilt on those towers. I find my eyes constantly moving around the outside of the image and struggling to find a single focal point. This makes me feel rather dispassionately about it. Personally I''d have given it a 5 or 6, so I can''t understand the 3s you''re getting. I''d have estimated this to finish around 5.5, but it may be scoring low because of the other ''cube'' pics?</td>', 'It''s a very bright and colourful image that clearly meets the challenge so I can''t see people voting it down for that. Exposure and focus seem fine, white balance seems spot on. The strong shadows might put some people off. The composition feels a little ''tense'', possibly because of the tilt on those towers. I find my eyes constantly moving around the outside of the image and struggling to find a single focal point. This makes me feel rather dispassionately about it. Personally I''d have given it a 5 or 6, so I can''t understand the 3s you''re getting. I''d have estimated this to finish around 5.5, but it may be scoring low because of the other ''cube'' pics?', '2009-02-25 13:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274463, 767732, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great idea and looks good.</td>', 'Great idea and looks good.', '2009-02-25 13:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274464, 768128, 18655, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Too bad the pillow (or whatever it is) is laying on the coach in the background. Otherwise very good!</td>', 'Great shot. Too bad the pillow (or whatever it is) is laying on the coach in the background. Otherwise very good!', '2009-02-25 13:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5274465, 768198, 18655, '<td valign="top">Puzzling in more ways than one! :) Sharp, interesting, thought provoking and overall great shot. 7</td>', 'Puzzling in more ways than one! :) Sharp, interesting, thought provoking and overall great shot. 7', '2009-02-25 13:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
