(5275738, 767498, 100495, '<td valign="top">I''m seeing a beautiful image of a beautiful object. Excellent lighting, composition, crop, colours etc. However I''m not seeing either a puzzle or something puzzling.</td>', 'I''m seeing a beautiful image of a beautiful object. Excellent lighting, composition, crop, colours etc. However I''m not seeing either a puzzle or something puzzling.', '2009-02-26 08:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275752, 767530, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that I get it, but I like it. The shape on the left reminds me of a snowflake. I don''t mind the shadows because they''re soft and I think it adds to the depth of the picture. Colors are relaxing, calm.</td>', 'I''m not sure that I get it, but I like it. The shape on the left reminds me of a snowflake. I don''t mind the shadows because they''re soft and I think it adds to the depth of the picture. Colors are relaxing, calm.', '2009-02-26 08:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275760, 768146, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wow, now this has great pop to it! This fits the challenge perfectly. The colors are simply amazing. I feel like I''m in Willy Wonka''s factory. I''m usually not a big fan of hallways/streets/etc. running straight down the pic and ending right in the middle, but I think this one has enough zing to it that it doesn''t catch my focus so much. I think this will do very well!</td>', 'Wow, now this has great pop to it! This fits the challenge perfectly. The colors are simply amazing. I feel like I''m in Willy Wonka''s factory. I''m usually not a big fan of hallways/streets/etc. running straight down the pic and ending right in the middle, but I think this one has enough zing to it that it doesn''t catch my focus so much. I think this will do very well!', '2009-02-26 09:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275761, 768042, 98141, '<td valign="top">Simple, but fantastic. The shadows work so well here, good job with the spotlights. Nice composition and framing, I like that you didn''t cut off too much of any of the shadows. Great subdued colors, they feel very warm.</td>', 'Simple, but fantastic. The shadows work so well here, good job with the spotlights. Nice composition and framing, I like that you didn''t cut off too much of any of the shadows. Great subdued colors, they feel very warm.', '2009-02-26 09:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275763, 767860, 98141, '<td valign="top">Aw, rubik''s cube graveyard? Good dof, great colors. The reflection isn''t strong enough to hold its own imho and I think it''s distracting. A plainer background would also be less distracting, especially if that dark circle-spot wasn''t there.</td>', 'Aw, rubik''s cube graveyard? Good dof, great colors. The reflection isn''t strong enough to hold its own imho and I think it''s distracting. A plainer background would also be less distracting, especially if that dark circle-spot wasn''t there.', '2009-02-26 09:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275764, 767467, 98141, '<td valign="top">Simple and funny and an interesting take on the challenge, but this lacks the x-factor. The composition is too straightforward for me and the background is too dull - the stark whiteness of the thought bubble kind of makes the wall seem dirty to me.</td>', 'Simple and funny and an interesting take on the challenge, but this lacks the x-factor. The composition is too straightforward for me and the background is too dull - the stark whiteness of the thought bubble kind of makes the wall seem dirty to me.', '2009-02-26 09:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275766, 768193, 98141, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of my college days when I would do Sudoku in a pen... often, a bad choice. I like the pop of the blue. I find the open triangle of space in the lower-right corner distracting, perhaps a tighter crop?</td>', 'This reminds me of my college days when I would do Sudoku in a pen... often, a bad choice. I like the pop of the blue. I find the open triangle of space in the lower-right corner distracting, perhaps a tighter crop?', '2009-02-26 09:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275769, 767365, 98141, '<td valign="top">Whoa, this really grabbed me! I love the colors, the yellows bring a nice energy to this. I like the light-at-the-end-of-the-tunnel feeling. I like that you can''t really see any clear people so it''s hard to judge how bit it is. Great composition. So eye-catching, well done!</td>', 'Whoa, this really grabbed me! I love the colors, the yellows bring a nice energy to this. I like the light-at-the-end-of-the-tunnel feeling. I like that you can''t really see any clear people so it''s hard to judge how bit it is. Great composition. So eye-catching, well done!', '2009-02-26 09:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275774, 768242, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, the reflections are bright enough to hold their own and not look messy, the colors really pop, the background is simple but adds to the mood of the pic. I do think that if the shadows were softer I''d like that.</td>', 'Nicely done, the reflections are bright enough to hold their own and not look messy, the colors really pop, the background is simple but adds to the mood of the pic. I do think that if the shadows were softer I''d like that.', '2009-02-26 09:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275777, 767371, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool subject. I''m not sure that I find it particularly puzzling. I wish the focus were a bit sharper. I love the way the sun glints off of that big drop near the bottom. I think the extra twig is distracting, wish that weren''t there.</td>', 'This is a really cool subject. I''m not sure that I find it particularly puzzling. I wish the focus were a bit sharper. I love the way the sun glints off of that big drop near the bottom. I think the extra twig is distracting, wish that weren''t there.', '2009-02-26 09:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275781, 768149, 98141, '<td valign="top">I am puzzled, I want to read how you did this... Nice colors. It seems it could be a bit sharper to me and I wish it were. I also think a black background might be nice, a little less white-intense so we could focus on the colors more? Not sure if that would work or not.</td>', 'I am puzzled, I want to read how you did this... Nice colors. It seems it could be a bit sharper to me and I wish it were. I also think a black background might be nice, a little less white-intense so we could focus on the colors more? Not sure if that would work or not.', '2009-02-26 09:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275782, 767475, 98141, '<td valign="top">I am puzzled, I will say that...</td>', 'I am puzzled, I will say that...', '2009-02-26 09:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275784, 768182, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very cool, I''ve always wanted to try a pic like this. Great job with the setup and lighting. Nice composition too, I love all the blank, white space.</td>', 'Very cool, I''ve always wanted to try a pic like this. Great job with the setup and lighting. Nice composition too, I love all the blank, white space.', '2009-02-26 09:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275790, 767768, 98141, '<td valign="top">The background feels so uniformly blurry and lit, it''s like this was taken in front of a photograph. I don''t care much for this. The placement of the pacifier is good, but I find a lot about this lacking.</td>', 'The background feels so uniformly blurry and lit, it''s like this was taken in front of a photograph. I don''t care much for this. The placement of the pacifier is good, but I find a lot about this lacking.', '2009-02-26 09:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275795, 768221, 98141, '<td valign="top">Not sure what''s/who''s puzzled in this. The corner of the rug is very distracting. So is the couch and the shadows from the flash. And it''s not very sharp.</td>', 'Not sure what''s/who''s puzzled in this. The corner of the rug is very distracting. So is the couch and the shadows from the flash. And it''s not very sharp.', '2009-02-26 09:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275797, 768220, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like this, feels like an ice sculpture. I think it would pop more if there were some kind of bright background to it instead of white.</td>', 'I like this, feels like an ice sculpture. I think it would pop more if there were some kind of bright background to it instead of white.', '2009-02-26 09:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275800, 767035, 98141, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I wouldn''t have considered this a puzzle. I think the subject is cool but I find the final product lacking. There''s no style nor wow factor, there''s no story... It''s just the tops of some plants. I imagine that I would like this more if it were a macro of the leaves, which are very cool. More of an abstract shot.</td>', 'Without the title, I wouldn''t have considered this a puzzle. I think the subject is cool but I find the final product lacking. There''s no style nor wow factor, there''s no story... It''s just the tops of some plants. I imagine that I would like this more if it were a macro of the leaves, which are very cool. More of an abstract shot.', '2009-02-26 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275801, 767174, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is a cute portrait, I love the pop of the colors and I think the lighting is very well done. I think the composition could be a little more exciting if she weren''t right in the middle.</td>', 'This is a cute portrait, I love the pop of the colors and I think the lighting is very well done. I think the composition could be a little more exciting if she weren''t right in the middle.', '2009-02-26 09:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275816, 767085, 98141, '<td valign="top">Trap? Yes. Whatever this is looks deadly. I like the colors and the way the tines seem wrapped up in mulit-colored bubbles. The composition is good and I think you''ve made a good use of the natural framing of this thing.</td>', 'Trap? Yes. Whatever this is looks deadly. I like the colors and the way the tines seem wrapped up in mulit-colored bubbles. The composition is good and I think you''ve made a good use of the natural framing of this thing.', '2009-02-26 09:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275818, 768216, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think this is my favorite Rubik''s Cube pic so far. I like the composition and the setup. I wish there weren''t so many shadows to distract me.</td>', 'I think this is my favorite Rubik''s Cube pic so far. I like the composition and the setup. I wish there weren''t so many shadows to distract me.', '2009-02-26 09:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275822, 767747, 98141, '<td valign="top">A nice capture of a natural puzzle. Nice composition, I love that the ice fills up the majority of the space. Seems a little grainy to me.</td>', 'A nice capture of a natural puzzle. Nice composition, I love that the ice fills up the majority of the space. Seems a little grainy to me.', '2009-02-26 09:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275828, 767091, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great composition and dof. This doesn''t scream puzzled to me, but I suppose your title captures that. I love the colors and the subject.</td>', 'Great composition and dof. This doesn''t scream puzzled to me, but I suppose your title captures that. I love the colors and the subject.', '2009-02-26 09:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275833, 767949, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, and I think it''s well put together. I think a slightly closer crop on the top would be nice to eliminate the little bit of purple up there that I find distracting.</td>', 'I like this idea, and I think it''s well put together. I think a slightly closer crop on the top would be nice to eliminate the little bit of purple up there that I find distracting.', '2009-02-26 09:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275836, 767551, 98141, '<td valign="top">The clown silhouettes are too cool. I think this is a very cool photo. I like the pop of red and the composition is just fantastic. Well done!</td>', 'The clown silhouettes are too cool. I think this is a very cool photo. I like the pop of red and the composition is just fantastic. Well done!', '2009-02-26 09:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275841, 767892, 98141, '<td valign="top">I can''t vote on this or give it much of a comment because ants are pretty much the one thing in life that I have a phobia of - give me snakes and tarantulas any time, I can''t understand why people are scared of those. Sorry that''s not helpful, but I wanted to give everybody something to read... PM me a pic of a different subject from your portfolio and I''ll be happy to give my thoughts. ::shivers::</td>', 'I can''t vote on this or give it much of a comment because ants are pretty much the one thing in life that I have a phobia of - give me snakes and tarantulas any time, I can''t understand why people are scared of those. Sorry that''s not helpful, but I wanted to give everybody something to read... PM me a pic of a different subject from your portfolio and I''ll be happy to give my thoughts. ::shivers::', '2009-02-26 09:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275844, 766754, 99263, '<td valign="top">Great idea ( I see someone else had the same idea also) Nicely executed. You might have considered leaving a few pieces of the puzzle out for more effect (the missing pieces so to speak) I like the combination of B&amp;W with color here and the background is interesting too. Not too keen on the angled frame as I feel it sort of unbalances the total image.  8</td>', 'Great idea ( I see someone else had the same idea also) Nicely executed. You might have considered leaving a few pieces of the puzzle out for more effect (the missing pieces so to speak) I like the combination of B&W with color here and the background is interesting too. Not too keen on the angled frame as I feel it sort of unbalances the total image.  8', '2009-02-26 09:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275845, 768186, 99263, '<td valign="top">Great idea ( I see someone else had the same idea also) and superb technical execution. Will take the Blue ribbon imo but if not will definitely place 2nd or 3rd.  10</td>', 'Great idea ( I see someone else had the same idea also) and superb technical execution. Will take the Blue ribbon imo but if not will definitely place 2nd or 3rd.  10', '2009-02-26 09:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275872, 768078, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this and the black background. I think the cushion would look pretty cool alone, but the pins add nice depth to the picture.</td>', 'I love the colors in this and the black background. I think the cushion would look pretty cool alone, but the pins add nice depth to the picture.', '2009-02-26 10:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275873, 768222, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m not really seeing "puzzled" here, but I do like the picture. Great DOF, love the black background, I could see this hanging from somebody''s wall.</td>', 'I''m not really seeing "puzzled" here, but I do like the picture. Great DOF, love the black background, I could see this hanging from somebody''s wall.', '2009-02-26 10:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275874, 768214, 98141, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, but the execution is a little plain for me. I think maybe adding a bowl and spoon would be a nice touch, or even a kid with a quizzical look on his or her face. I think a closer shot/crop might make this plain shot stand out a little more as well.</td>', 'Cute idea, but the execution is a little plain for me. I think maybe adding a bowl and spoon would be a nice touch, or even a kid with a quizzical look on his or her face. I think a closer shot/crop might make this plain shot stand out a little more as well.', '2009-02-26 10:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275875, 768049, 98141, '<td valign="top">Blurry. Dark, sharp shadows from lighting.  Distracting texture in the carpet. Take a little more time with it.</td>', 'Blurry. Dark, sharp shadows from lighting.  Distracting texture in the carpet. Take a little more time with it.', '2009-02-26 10:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275876, 767890, 98141, '<td valign="top">There is something spspecial about this pic, I love the idea of it and I think the reflections are fun but not so distorted that they''re distracting. The triangle of non-mirror in the lower left is a bit distracting.</td>', 'There is something spspecial about this pic, I love the idea of it and I think the reflections are fun but not so distorted that they''re distracting. The triangle of non-mirror in the lower left is a bit distracting.', '2009-02-26 10:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275878, 767771, 98141, '<td valign="top">I see that you''re trying, but I''m not sure the execution is exactly what you might have been aiming for? The pieces seem accidental, not artistic. I''d like it better if the puzzle were more purposeful looking.</td>', 'I see that you''re trying, but I''m not sure the execution is exactly what you might have been aiming for? The pieces seem accidental, not artistic. I''d like it better if the puzzle were more purposeful looking.', '2009-02-26 10:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275882, 766836, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. That said, the execution leaves a little to be desired. It looks messy. It''s not super sharp, it''s not got a wow factor to it, and the overall result is a little dull.</td>', 'I like the idea. That said, the execution leaves a little to be desired. It looks messy. It''s not super sharp, it''s not got a wow factor to it, and the overall result is a little dull.', '2009-02-26 10:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275884, 768261, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the pop of color. I''m not sure I get the wastebasket or the shreds of paper. This might be nice and simple without that addition. Nice composition. Nice clarity.</td>', 'I love the pop of color. I''m not sure I get the wastebasket or the shreds of paper. This might be nice and simple without that addition. Nice composition. Nice clarity.', '2009-02-26 10:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275885, 768246, 100495, '<td valign="top">Very clever but DNMC.<br/> <br/>Only joking, 8.</td>', 'Very clever but DNMC. Only joking, 8.', '2009-02-26 10:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275890, 767218, 100495, '<td valign="top">The components of this image appear very artificial and incoherent, but I can''t quite work out what''s in the original and what''s added. I''m afraid it doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'The components of this image appear very artificial and incoherent, but I can''t quite work out what''s in the original and what''s added. I''m afraid it doesn''t work for me.', '2009-02-26 10:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
