(5275913, 767788, 98141, '<td valign="top">Actually, I think I prefer the original plant better... at least to eat. But this looks cool, looks like it took a lot of time and effort to get right. Colors are great, lighting is good, and it''s a clever idea.</td>', 'Actually, I think I prefer the original plant better... at least to eat. But this looks cool, looks like it took a lot of time and effort to get right. Colors are great, lighting is good, and it''s a clever idea.', '2009-02-26 10:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
