(5275915, 767821, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m really not a huge fan of pictures that are of people taking pictures of paper. I like that you added the puzzle pieces and I think the theme is particularly relevant today, but it''s just too plain for me to get into it.</td>', 'I''m really not a huge fan of pictures that are of people taking pictures of paper. I like that you added the puzzle pieces and I think the theme is particularly relevant today, but it''s just too plain for me to get into it.', '2009-02-26 10:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275917, 767951, 98141, '<td valign="top">A clever DPC twist on a classic puzzle, but I think it leaves something to be desired. I love the stark white against the black, but I almost feel like I would like it better with a square frame and no tilt and no pen.</td>', 'A clever DPC twist on a classic puzzle, but I think it leaves something to be desired. I love the stark white against the black, but I almost feel like I would like it better with a square frame and no tilt and no pen.', '2009-02-26 10:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275918, 767897, 98141, '<td valign="top">Love this. The simplicity of it. The texture of it. The lighting and composition are nice. Great job.</td>', 'Love this. The simplicity of it. The texture of it. The lighting and composition are nice. Great job.', '2009-02-26 10:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275919, 768127, 98141, '<td valign="top">Not in sharp focus, not particularly puzzling, dull composition and just not my cup of tea.</td>', 'Not in sharp focus, not particularly puzzling, dull composition and just not my cup of tea.', '2009-02-26 10:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275922, 766655, 100495, '<td valign="top">Beautiful processing and a really interesting image.</td>', 'Beautiful processing and a really interesting image.', '2009-02-26 10:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275930, 768023, 100495, '<td valign="top">Great use of dead space.</td>', 'Great use of dead space.', '2009-02-26 10:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275936, 768250, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love this, I think the placement of the bars is well done and the reflections and colors are just so creepy, and I''ve always found Dali''s work to be a little creepy. I think this is very stylistic in a really good way.</td>', 'I love this, I think the placement of the bars is well done and the reflections and colors are just so creepy, and I''ve always found Dali''s work to be a little creepy. I think this is very stylistic in a really good way.', '2009-02-26 10:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275937, 768213, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love this, the lighting, the texture of the skin. A natural puzzle. Well done!</td>', 'I love this, the lighting, the texture of the skin. A natural puzzle. Well done!', '2009-02-26 10:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275938, 767660, 100495, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and a really interesting and busy composition. I think the spoon needs to be obviously bent though.</td>', 'Great lighting and a really interesting and busy composition. I think the spoon needs to be obviously bent though.', '2009-02-26 10:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275940, 767771, 100495, '<td valign="top">You have obviously put a lot of thought and effort into this. Nice lighting and colours.</td>', 'You have obviously put a lot of thought and effort into this. Nice lighting and colours.', '2009-02-26 10:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275941, 768121, 98141, '<td valign="top">Okay, there are a lot of basic things that I think will bring the score for this pic down. The bright reflection off of the piece in the lower-middle of the pic. The distracting edges (upper right corner and lower edge). The darkness of the rest of the pic especially compared to that strong glare in the middle. It definitely meets the challenge, but it could use some tweaking.</td>', 'Okay, there are a lot of basic things that I think will bring the score for this pic down. The bright reflection off of the piece in the lower-middle of the pic. The distracting edges (upper right corner and lower edge). The darkness of the rest of the pic especially compared to that strong glare in the middle. It definitely meets the challenge, but it could use some tweaking.', '2009-02-26 10:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275943, 767889, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love this vivid green color. I don''t think I get the pic though, maybe it''s a joke that''s over my head? Phone salad? I think a macro of just the lettuce might have been even cooler, it has such a cool texture and I think that it might qualify as a puzzle of sorts.</td>', 'I love this vivid green color. I don''t think I get the pic though, maybe it''s a joke that''s over my head? Phone salad? I think a macro of just the lettuce might have been even cooler, it has such a cool texture and I think that it might qualify as a puzzle of sorts.', '2009-02-26 10:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275947, 768159, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''ve just learned a new word, which is great timing since I''m taking the GRE in a couple of weeks, so thank you. I like the color vs. b&amp;w in this pic. It feels slighty oof to me, maybe because I''m fighting a fever?</td>', 'I''ve just learned a new word, which is great timing since I''m taking the GRE in a couple of weeks, so thank you. I like the color vs. b&w in this pic. It feels slighty oof to me, maybe because I''m fighting a fever?', '2009-02-26 10:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5275948, 767477, 98141, '<td valign="top">I wish the little distractions weren''t in this pic - the heater, the frog pic, the lizard hook. The smiley face pj bottoms make a nice contrast to the subject''s face though.</td>', 'I wish the little distractions weren''t in this pic - the heater, the frog pic, the lizard hook. The smiley face pj bottoms make a nice contrast to the subject''s face though.', '2009-02-26 10:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
