(5276287, 768209, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this, but I''m not a huge fan of the execution. Problem is, I''m not even sure what part doesn''t resonate with me. I think it''s the face that it looks like it''s taped to a table but I feel like it should be taped vertically to a wall or something.</td>', 'I like the idea of this, but I''m not a huge fan of the execution. Problem is, I''m not even sure what part doesn''t resonate with me. I think it''s the face that it looks like it''s taped to a table but I feel like it should be taped vertically to a wall or something.', '2009-02-26 15:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276289, 767748, 98141, '<td valign="top">What a cruel joke! Whoever came up with that contraption should be hunted. And Rioja Crianza, above that! One of my favorite regions... This pic is just making me depressed! I suppose that means you''ve succeeded.</td>', 'What a cruel joke! Whoever came up with that contraption should be hunted. And Rioja Crianza, above that! One of my favorite regions... This pic is just making me depressed! I suppose that means you''ve succeeded.', '2009-02-26 15:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276292, 768054, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is hard to see for me. I think perhaps larger puzzle pieces wouldn''t make it so difficult to make out. Also, perhaps a lighter background (white instead of black?). It might be cool to see the light coming through the pieces.</td>', 'This is hard to see for me. I think perhaps larger puzzle pieces wouldn''t make it so difficult to make out. Also, perhaps a lighter background (white instead of black?). It might be cool to see the light coming through the pieces.', '2009-02-26 15:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276294, 767095, 98141, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think this is pushing it, but I''m going to go with the flow. Fabulous DOF, great colors and I''m always a sucker for square framing. I''m  not a fan of big, bright borders though, but be aware that it is a personal bias and I don''t think it makes this pic worse.</td>', 'Personally, I think this is pushing it, but I''m going to go with the flow. Fabulous DOF, great colors and I''m always a sucker for square framing. I''m  not a fan of big, bright borders though, but be aware that it is a personal bias and I don''t think it makes this pic worse.', '2009-02-26 15:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276295, 768268, 98141, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant in a way. I think this would look fabulous on black, the silver standing out against the darkness and no shadows. Nice composition.</td>', 'Simple and elegant in a way. I think this would look fabulous on black, the silver standing out against the darkness and no shadows. Nice composition.', '2009-02-26 15:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276297, 768023, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ooh, I like this, I was imagining something like this for somebody else''s picture. Simple but fun to look at and definitely meets the challenge. Good job.</td>', 'Ooh, I like this, I was imagining something like this for somebody else''s picture. Simple but fun to look at and definitely meets the challenge. Good job.', '2009-02-26 15:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276301, 768021, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what about this is puzzling, maybe I just don''t get it... I love how soft he looks though, I would want to cuddle with him (her?) if I didn''t know s/he had sharp teeth in there too.</td>', 'I''m not sure what about this is puzzling, maybe I just don''t get it... I love how soft he looks though, I would want to cuddle with him (her?) if I didn''t know s/he had sharp teeth in there too.', '2009-02-26 15:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276306, 768186, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ha, well done! Some people can pull off this trick so well. I really want to try something like this someday.Great composition and I think it turned out quite well.</td>', 'Ha, well done! Some people can pull off this trick so well. I really want to try something like this someday.Great composition and I think it turned out quite well.', '2009-02-26 15:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276310, 768117, 98141, '<td valign="top">Okay, I feel that this meets the challenge, but I don''t think that it is executed well. The yellow bit in the bottom left feels out-of-place and is distracting. Also, I think it could be sharper (but that might be the fever talking). The colors just seem kind of bland to me. Nothing pops about this pic.</td>', 'Okay, I feel that this meets the challenge, but I don''t think that it is executed well. The yellow bit in the bottom left feels out-of-place and is distracting. Also, I think it could be sharper (but that might be the fever talking). The colors just seem kind of bland to me. Nothing pops about this pic.', '2009-02-26 15:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276311, 768114, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like these sort of natural puzzles. I love the rusty color against the harshness of the ice here.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-04 14:28:52.</i></td>', 'I like these sort of natural puzzles. I love the rusty color against the harshness of the ice here.', '2009-02-26 15:14:25.000000', '2009-03-04 14:28:52.000000', 1),
(5276317, 767334, 98141, '<td valign="top">There was another pic that I commented on that kind of reminds me of this one, even though the subjects are completely different. I think this would have done better in this challenge if the texture of the rocks was the focus instead of the shape - more of a close-up would be more "puzzled" to me I suppose. I also love the colors but wouldn''t mind if they were a bit more saturated.</td>', 'There was another pic that I commented on that kind of reminds me of this one, even though the subjects are completely different. I think this would have done better in this challenge if the texture of the rocks was the focus instead of the shape - more of a close-up would be more "puzzled" to me I suppose. I also love the colors but wouldn''t mind if they were a bit more saturated.', '2009-02-26 15:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276320, 767903, 98141, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, a different take on the puzzled faces we''ve seen in this challenge. Nice focus on the eyes. I''m glad you decided not to put one of the shadow lines right through the pupil or something.</td>', 'Cool idea, a different take on the puzzled faces we''ve seen in this challenge. Nice focus on the eyes. I''m glad you decided not to put one of the shadow lines right through the pupil or something.', '2009-02-26 15:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276328, 768255, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think the composition here is well put together and I dig the colors, but this just doesn''t grab me and I''m having a hard time putting my finger on why. I think maybe some extra negative space at the top might make it feel a little less crowded.</td>', 'I think the composition here is well put together and I dig the colors, but this just doesn''t grab me and I''m having a hard time putting my finger on why. I think maybe some extra negative space at the top might make it feel a little less crowded.', '2009-02-26 15:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276335, 767218, 98141, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''m really not sure what this has to do with being puzzled. Maybe me being puzzled about why this supposedly represents being puzzled is the trick? So I suppose it does qualify, but in an awfully roundabout way ;) Not the best street shot I''ve seen, but it is kind of funny to watch him chase that balloon while the guy next to him just looks so bored. What''s a cheese steak? That sounds icky.</td>', 'Okay, I''m really not sure what this has to do with being puzzled. Maybe me being puzzled about why this supposedly represents being puzzled is the trick? So I suppose it does qualify, but in an awfully roundabout way ;) Not the best street shot I''ve seen, but it is kind of funny to watch him chase that balloon while the guy next to him just looks so bored. What''s a cheese steak? That sounds icky.', '2009-02-26 15:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276338, 768143, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ooh, clever idea! Though I usually frown upon portraits that zoom right up the subject''s nostrils, I think it makes for a unique perspective in this. I think it would also be cool just to see an eye or eyes peering through. I like this idea, I might use it sometime to try it out.</td>', 'Ooh, clever idea! Though I usually frown upon portraits that zoom right up the subject''s nostrils, I think it makes for a unique perspective in this. I think it would also be cool just to see an eye or eyes peering through. I like this idea, I might use it sometime to try it out.', '2009-02-26 15:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276340, 767982, 98141, '<td valign="top">Hahahaha, this really made me smile. Love the contrast and the b&amp;w in this. Great idea.</td>', 'Hahahaha, this really made me smile. Love the contrast and the b&w in this. Great idea.', '2009-02-26 15:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276344, 767688, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but the execution is a little rough. The yellos caution tape in the lower right, the yellow on the sidewalk in the lower left, the telephone wire or whatever it is cutting through the left side, the busy background - these are all distraction that take away from the actual picture. That being said, it looks like you went through a lot of work to put this together, so keep it up but focus on the details for the next one.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but the execution is a little rough. The yellos caution tape in the lower right, the yellow on the sidewalk in the lower left, the telephone wire or whatever it is cutting through the left side, the busy background - these are all distraction that take away from the actual picture. That being said, it looks like you went through a lot of work to put this together, so keep it up but focus on the details for the next one.', '2009-02-26 15:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276345, 767888, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ah, I saw another similar to this but I think the detail of having the pieces around the shining piece adds something extra to this version. I like this a lot. It''s simple but clean. Good job.</td>', 'Ah, I saw another similar to this but I think the detail of having the pieces around the shining piece adds something extra to this version. I like this a lot. It''s simple but clean. Good job.', '2009-02-26 15:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276351, 767006, 98141, '<td valign="top">Aw, this is way to cute to pick on it for not inherently matching the theme. A little more clarity and a little more use of bokeh might really make this pop. I bet it looks nice in colors too.</td>', 'Aw, this is way to cute to pick on it for not inherently matching the theme. A little more clarity and a little more use of bokeh might really make this pop. I bet it looks nice in colors too.', '2009-02-26 15:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276365, 768120, 14867, '<td valign="top">Cleverly meets the challenge. A superb image.</td>', 'Cleverly meets the challenge. A superb image.', '2009-02-26 15:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276371, 767989, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like simple photos, but I think this might be both over-simplefied and not simplefied enough. The background isn''t smooth enough to let the pieces shine on their own. And the pieces leave so much blank space with that rough looking bacground. I just find that both aspects distract from the other.</td>', 'I like simple photos, but I think this might be both over-simplefied and not simplefied enough. The background isn''t smooth enough to let the pieces shine on their own. And the pieces leave so much blank space with that rough looking bacground. I just find that both aspects distract from the other.', '2009-02-26 15:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276373, 767732, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the one piece that pops, give the picture focus. This is good. The shadows are a little busy at the top, but overall the product is nice.</td>', 'I like the one piece that pops, give the picture focus. This is good. The shadows are a little busy at the top, but overall the product is nice.', '2009-02-26 15:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
