(5276611, 768213, 92512, '<td valign="top">Good Shot</td>', 'Good Shot', '2009-02-26 17:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276613, 768002, 61818, '<td valign="top">Concept is good.  Little kid puzzled by the great mystery of tying shoe strings.  However the laces are obscured so any impact they might have provided (think a big tangle) is missing.  Primary focal point of the shot is a toss up between face and point of puzzlement (fingers and shoelaces).  The face is well displayed, but the expression comes across as boredom or concentration rather than a puzzled child.  Hands/shoe are pushed up against the frame and come across as incidental to the shot entirely (reinforced by part of the left hand being cropped).  Processing is nice, has a nostalgic feel.</td>', 'Concept is good.  Little kid puzzled by the great mystery of tying shoe strings.  However the laces are obscured so any impact they might have provided (think a big tangle) is missing.  Primary focal point of the shot is a toss up between face and point of puzzlement (fingers and shoelaces).  The face is well displayed, but the expression comes across as boredom or concentration rather than a puzzled child.  Hands/shoe are pushed up against the frame and come across as incidental to the shot entirely (reinforced by part of the left hand being cropped).  Processing is nice, has a nostalgic feel.', '2009-02-26 17:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276617, 766771, 86447, '<td valign="top">I really hate this title... I''m sorry that it''s come to that...  LOL!   But, it has.  Every animal looking at the camera has this title. <br/> <br/>Sorry.  Ranting is over for now.  *grin*<br/> <br/>Now, on to the stuff that matters...  I like the idea of this... but I need to see more detail.   With Advanced Editing you could have dodged the shadows and highlights to bring out the eyes a bit.  Or maybe it''s too much of a crop for that?   Is there any detail left in the shadows?<br/> <br/>Anyway... I like the diagonal of the branch as a leading line... I just wish there were more detail, especially in the eyes and the feathers.<br/> <br/>Oh yeah... and find a different title.  *grin*</td>', 'I really hate this title... I''m sorry that it''s come to that...  LOL!   But, it has.  Every animal looking at the camera has this title.  Sorry.  Ranting is over for now.  *grin* Now, on to the stuff that matters...  I like the idea of this... but I need to see more detail.   With Advanced Editing you could have dodged the shadows and highlights to bring out the eyes a bit.  Or maybe it''s too much of a crop for that?   Is there any detail left in the shadows? Anyway... I like the diagonal of the branch as a leading line... I just wish there were more detail, especially in the eyes and the feathers. Oh yeah... and find a different title.  *grin*', '2009-02-26 17:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276621, 767892, 86447, '<td valign="top">Looks like somebody has the same dust on their sensor that I have... *sigh*  The good news is that removing it is legal in even Basic Editing... and Advanced Editing.   ''Nough said about that.<br/> <br/>I''d like a bit more detail in the ant.   Perhaps some dodging/burning or Shadow/highlights for this??<br/> <br/>Also, a less centered subject would score more highly, I think.   I''d have cropped off a bit on the left and a smidgeon on the top.  <br/> <br/>But, I''m just an amateur... so do as you wish.  :)</td>', 'Looks like somebody has the same dust on their sensor that I have... *sigh*  The good news is that removing it is legal in even Basic Editing... and Advanced Editing.   ''Nough said about that. I''d like a bit more detail in the ant.   Perhaps some dodging/burning or Shadow/highlights for this?? Also, a less centered subject would score more highly, I think.   I''d have cropped off a bit on the left and a smidgeon on the top.   But, I''m just an amateur... so do as you wish.  :)', '2009-02-26 17:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276623, 768114, 61818, '<td valign="top">Not so subtle play on the theme of puzzle, with cracked ice as the pieces.  Exposure is good, composition is fine though the red iron ring pulls the eye given its placement in the frame, and really has nothing to offer in return.  While technically competent, the photo itself is rather lifeless, offering nothing of interest beyond an allusion to the challenge theme.  That''s not said as an insult, but rather a call to step up the creativity to a level that matches the technical prowess.</td>', 'Not so subtle play on the theme of puzzle, with cracked ice as the pieces.  Exposure is good, composition is fine though the red iron ring pulls the eye given its placement in the frame, and really has nothing to offer in return.  While technically competent, the photo itself is rather lifeless, offering nothing of interest beyond an allusion to the challenge theme.  That''s not said as an insult, but rather a call to step up the creativity to a level that matches the technical prowess.', '2009-02-26 17:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276624, 767218, 86447, '<td valign="top">Now... WHERE have I seen this before??</td>', 'Now... WHERE have I seen this before??', '2009-02-26 17:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276628, 767440, 61818, '<td valign="top">An unbalanced composition.  The photo is divided into quadrants, with the only substantial object occupying the upper left.  The box is less a puzzle than an arrangement of product labels, and the photo itself entirely reliant upon the title for any sort of substance or meaning.  Shallow dof to bring the ashtray into the composition is a nice consideration, but doesn''t really add anything to the shot.  The lower right corner is dying for <i>something</i> to occupy the space and anchor the shot.</td>', 'An unbalanced composition.  The photo is divided into quadrants, with the only substantial object occupying the upper left.  The box is less a puzzle than an arrangement of product labels, and the photo itself entirely reliant upon the title for any sort of substance or meaning.  Shallow dof to bring the ashtray into the composition is a nice consideration, but doesn''t really add anything to the shot.  The lower right corner is dying for something to occupy the space and anchor the shot.', '2009-02-26 18:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276640, 768078, 61818, '<td valign="top">Other than puzzle piece shapes on the pin cushion, there''s really nothing to this photo.  The placement of the pins appears to be haphazard, and some have even been partially cropped by the edge of the frame or are partially disappearing into the large black void in the background.  There was probably a better, more creative approach to this subject.  Maybe even arranging the pins in the form of a question mark and composing so that the pin cushion fills the frame.  Something like that would give the photo something to say, a life of its own, rather than being a documentary shot of a pincushion.</td>', 'Other than puzzle piece shapes on the pin cushion, there''s really nothing to this photo.  The placement of the pins appears to be haphazard, and some have even been partially cropped by the edge of the frame or are partially disappearing into the large black void in the background.  There was probably a better, more creative approach to this subject.  Maybe even arranging the pins in the form of a question mark and composing so that the pin cushion fills the frame.  Something like that would give the photo something to say, a life of its own, rather than being a documentary shot of a pincushion.', '2009-02-26 18:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276646, 768213, 61818, '<td valign="top">Not really a puzzle, not really puzzling.  If ''woven'' is the harbinger of a puzzle, I have a stack of puzzles in my closet which keep me warm in the winter.  Goofy challenge theme aside, not a bad shot.  Composition is nice and good detail throughout most of the surface of the hands.  One hot spot in the lower left, and a number of areas where all shadow detail has been lost.  Overall not bad.</td>', 'Not really a puzzle, not really puzzling.  If ''woven'' is the harbinger of a puzzle, I have a stack of puzzles in my closet which keep me warm in the winter.  Goofy challenge theme aside, not a bad shot.  Composition is nice and good detail throughout most of the surface of the hands.  One hot spot in the lower left, and a number of areas where all shadow detail has been lost.  Overall not bad.', '2009-02-26 18:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276648, 768059, 61818, '<td valign="top">Next time maybe let the cat work the camera.  Enjoy the brown!</td>', 'Next time maybe let the cat work the camera.  Enjoy the brown!', '2009-02-26 18:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276653, 768222, 61818, '<td valign="top">Neither a puzzle nor puzzling as the subject matter is obvious.  Composition is rather poor here with no apparent concern as to the placement of the subject within the frame.  Large areas of black space in the lower half of the photo tend to reinforce the harsh light hitting the tops of the leaves.</td>', 'Neither a puzzle nor puzzling as the subject matter is obvious.  Composition is rather poor here with no apparent concern as to the placement of the subject within the frame.  Large areas of black space in the lower half of the photo tend to reinforce the harsh light hitting the tops of the leaves.', '2009-02-26 18:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276658, 768155, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.  Puzzling in a way.  Might have cropped it tighter, as the composition feels unbalanced due to the dominant lines riding up the left side of the frame and the left tilt of the major horizontal lines at the top of the liquid.  Toning of the water is pleasing, sickly cyan of the background not so much.</td>', 'Nice abstract.  Puzzling in a way.  Might have cropped it tighter, as the composition feels unbalanced due to the dominant lines riding up the left side of the frame and the left tilt of the major horizontal lines at the top of the liquid.  Toning of the water is pleasing, sickly cyan of the background not so much.', '2009-02-26 18:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276669, 766754, 61818, '<td valign="top">Ahh, selective desaturation in all its unappealing, gimicky glory.  Lot of bizarre elements in this shot and, despite the desat, an engaging and well done image!</td>', 'Ahh, selective desaturation in all its unappealing, gimicky glory.  Lot of bizarre elements in this shot and, despite the desat, an engaging and well done image!', '2009-02-26 18:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276674, 767798, 61818, '<td valign="top">While certainly a literal interpretation of ''puzzle'', the flat light and lack of any elements of interest kill the shot.</td>', 'While certainly a literal interpretation of ''puzzle'', the flat light and lack of any elements of interest kill the shot.', '2009-02-26 18:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276675, 766604, 61818, '<td valign="top">This is radically underexposed, I can barely make out the guy on the bench.  Composition is haphazard, and the photo feels like a snapshot.  Maybe getting lower to the ground and more to the left or right would have helped.  Maybe.</td>', 'This is radically underexposed, I can barely make out the guy on the bench.  Composition is haphazard, and the photo feels like a snapshot.  Maybe getting lower to the ground and more to the left or right would have helped.  Maybe.', '2009-02-26 18:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5276688, 766700, 46821, '<td valign="top">Absolutely amazing, great photo, brilliant house!</td>', 'Absolutely amazing, great photo, brilliant house!', '2009-02-26 18:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
