(5276822, 768234, 86447, '<td valign="top">HOW many images will be named this exact same title?  Not puzzling at all... almost ALL of the ones where the animal is looking at the camera.<br/> <br/>Oh.  Sorry.  I was ranting.   *sigh*<br/> <br/>Now on to the stuff that matters:    I''d really like to have a closer crop on the bird... and I need to see his eye(s).   With an Advanced Editing challenge some dodging/burning or shadow/highlights could be used.<br/> <br/>Also, I''d have cropped the image a bit more... so the bird is not looking "out of the image" but into it.   IE:   more off the left and a bit off the top to get him in the left third of the image.<br/> <br/>But, that''s just my opinion.  And every voter has one.  *grin*  I hope you do well.</td>', 'HOW many images will be named this exact same title?  Not puzzling at all... almost ALL of the ones where the animal is looking at the camera. Oh.  Sorry.  I was ranting.   *sigh* Now on to the stuff that matters:    I''d really like to have a closer crop on the bird... and I need to see his eye(s).   With an Advanced Editing challenge some dodging/burning or shadow/highlights could be used. Also, I''d have cropped the image a bit more... so the bird is not looking "out of the image" but into it.   IE:   more off the left and a bit off the top to get him in the left third of the image. But, that''s just my opinion.  And every voter has one.  *grin*  I hope you do well.', '2009-02-26 19:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
