(5277572, 768211, 86447, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... this is very clever!   I''m confused about the ''extra'' mouth on the shirt.   And I don''t like the partial bit of face and glasses... the hand and piece were enough, I think.<br/> <br/>I also wish the eyes were more in focus, but I do understand that problem.<br/> <br/>Those are just my opinions... and every voter will have one (or two).  *grin*<br/> <br/>Anyway, I hope this does well for you... despite the issues I have with it, it''s still a 6 in my book.  :)</td>', 'Hmmm... this is very clever!   I''m confused about the ''extra'' mouth on the shirt.   And I don''t like the partial bit of face and glasses... the hand and piece were enough, I think. I also wish the eyes were more in focus, but I do understand that problem. Those are just my opinions... and every voter will have one (or two).  *grin* Anyway, I hope this does well for you... despite the issues I have with it, it''s still a 6 in my book.  :)', '2009-02-27 10:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277575, 766700, 86447, '<td valign="top">Wow.  How totally bizzare.</td>', 'Wow.  How totally bizzare.', '2009-02-27 10:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277576, 767951, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Well done.  All of it.</td>', 'LOL!  Well done.  All of it.', '2009-02-27 10:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277589, 768107, 100727, '<td valign="top">Very nice structure/design.  I love the contrast of the foreground against the highlight at the centre, and then the dark background.  It''s really beautiful.</td>', 'Very nice structure/design.  I love the contrast of the foreground against the highlight at the centre, and then the dark background.  It''s really beautiful.', '2009-02-27 10:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277618, 767498, 100727, '<td valign="top">Very artsy.  I like it.  Looks like a bull''s horn to me :)  Is that flour?  Very nice puzzle.</td>', 'Very artsy.  I like it.  Looks like a bull''s horn to me :)  Is that flour?  Very nice puzzle.', '2009-02-27 11:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277639, 768225, 100727, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflection from the other building.  The colour and design are puzzling.</td>', 'Very nice reflection from the other building.  The colour and design are puzzling.', '2009-02-27 11:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277657, 768020, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love Babar! This photo just seems a little dark and the shadows are distracting. I think with some more balanced light and if the edge of the puzzle weren''t so crooked compared to the edge of the pic, that would be nice.</td>', 'I love Babar! This photo just seems a little dark and the shadows are distracting. I think with some more balanced light and if the edge of the puzzle weren''t so crooked compared to the edge of the pic, that would be nice.', '2009-02-27 11:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277659, 767208, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love this, the coldness of the metal, the darkness of it. I think your framing is perfect.</td>', 'I love this, the coldness of the metal, the darkness of it. I think your framing is perfect.', '2009-02-27 11:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277661, 768110, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m not 100% sure what''s I''m looking at here - it seems to be a stream of some sort. I wish it were clearer what it was right away, perhaps with more colors. Interesting concept, though.</td>', 'I''m not 100% sure what''s I''m looking at here - it seems to be a stream of some sort. I wish it were clearer what it was right away, perhaps with more colors. Interesting concept, though.', '2009-02-27 11:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277689, 767776, 98141, '<td valign="top">Clifford!! I''d know that paw print anywhere. This is neat, how''d you get up so high? Near the bottom it seems a little grainy and I feel like if there were more space above the print rather than below it there would be more of a sense of moving forward.</td>', 'Clifford!! I''d know that paw print anywhere. This is neat, how''d you get up so high? Near the bottom it seems a little grainy and I feel like if there were more space above the print rather than below it there would be more of a sense of moving forward.', '2009-02-27 11:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277691, 767359, 98141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, simple, subtle, I love this. The colors and lighting are fantastic. The subtle inclusion of a puzzle is great. Stunning.</td>', 'Beautiful, simple, subtle, I love this. The colors and lighting are fantastic. The subtle inclusion of a puzzle is great. Stunning.', '2009-02-27 11:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277695, 768198, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is a really fun portrait, fantastic eyes and nice focus. It pops! Good job.</td>', 'This is a really fun portrait, fantastic eyes and nice focus. It pops! Good job.', '2009-02-27 11:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277698, 767966, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like this take on the Rubik''s Cube - it''s a classic image, somebody concentrating on solving the little puzzle. Nice dof, nice colors in the cube.</td>', 'I like this take on the Rubik''s Cube - it''s a classic image, somebody concentrating on solving the little puzzle. Nice dof, nice colors in the cube.', '2009-02-27 11:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277704, 766832, 98141, '<td valign="top">I wish the trees weren''t there or that there were more of them framing the subject better, they feel accidental and distracting. That is the biggest flock of geese I think I''ve ever seen though. Holy cow.</td>', 'I wish the trees weren''t there or that there were more of them framing the subject better, they feel accidental and distracting. That is the biggest flock of geese I think I''ve ever seen though. Holy cow.', '2009-02-27 11:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277709, 766881, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m surprise you didn''t decide to do this in full color, those puzzles are usually so bright and fun. This is just a pic of a puzzle, nothing really innovative of new about it. It''s a nice, simple pic, but it doesn''t pop.</td>', 'I''m surprise you didn''t decide to do this in full color, those puzzles are usually so bright and fun. This is just a pic of a puzzle, nothing really innovative of new about it. It''s a nice, simple pic, but it doesn''t pop.', '2009-02-27 11:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277713, 767737, 98141, '<td valign="top">Strange photo to be sure. I like the way the line cuts across the pic, I think the composition is good. I wish it were a little sharper, especially the edges seem a bit blurry. I think this would look really cool in b&amp;w.</td>', 'Strange photo to be sure. I like the way the line cuts across the pic, I think the composition is good. I wish it were a little sharper, especially the edges seem a bit blurry. I think this would look really cool in b&w.', '2009-02-27 11:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277715, 768061, 98141, '<td valign="top">Whoa, zooming! This is fun, but I don''t get the feeling that it''s particularly puzzling. I like the colors and all though.</td>', 'Whoa, zooming! This is fun, but I don''t get the feeling that it''s particularly puzzling. I like the colors and all though.', '2009-02-27 11:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277721, 767664, 16402, '<td valign="top">Love the picture, just not for this challenge, sorry.</td>', 'Love the picture, just not for this challenge, sorry.', '2009-02-27 11:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277734, 768134, 98141, '<td valign="top">This looke gross to me, and I''m not a big fan of vitis labrusca in either case, but this certainly evokes a visceral reaction and so I say well done. It reminds me of cavities for some reason.</td>', 'This looke gross to me, and I''m not a big fan of vitis labrusca in either case, but this certainly evokes a visceral reaction and so I say well done. It reminds me of cavities for some reason.', '2009-02-27 11:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277735, 768267, 98141, '<td valign="top">I would like this a lot better if the sides were not included. The rest of the exhibits are really distracting.</td>', 'I would like this a lot better if the sides were not included. The rest of the exhibits are really distracting.', '2009-02-27 11:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277736, 768246, 16402, '<td valign="top">Very cool interpretation of the challenge! Perfectly executed. 9</td>', 'Very cool interpretation of the challenge! Perfectly executed. 9', '2009-02-27 11:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277738, 766798, 16402, '<td valign="top">Border really doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Border really doesn''t work for me.', '2009-02-27 11:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277740, 767320, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great dof, love the tones in this. It''s so simple but also well-executed. I feel like it''s hanging above a cradle or something.</td>', 'Great dof, love the tones in this. It''s so simple but also well-executed. I feel like it''s hanging above a cradle or something.', '2009-02-27 11:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277743, 767768, 16402, '<td valign="top">Sorry DNMC IMHO.</td>', 'Sorry DNMC IMHO.', '2009-02-27 11:31:34.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5277747, 768186, 16402, '<td valign="top">Excellent.</td>', 'Excellent.', '2009-02-27 11:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277749, 767869, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is interesting but I don''t feel like the execution is 100% on target. Great colors and I like that we can see light coming through the cracks of the other pieces, but something is missing, at least for me, and I can''t put my finger on what it is.</td>', 'This is interesting but I don''t feel like the execution is 100% on target. Great colors and I like that we can see light coming through the cracks of the other pieces, but something is missing, at least for me, and I can''t put my finger on what it is.', '2009-02-27 11:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277750, 767889, 16402, '<td valign="top">Sorry DNMC IMHO.</td>', 'Sorry DNMC IMHO.', '2009-02-27 11:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277753, 768200, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the sharpness of the white lines that seperate the pieces, but I don''t care much for the blank spots. The little black spots are very distracting, not sure what those are, but I wish it were all one color. I''m certain that it was part of the puzzle, out of your control, but that''s the first thing I noticed when I looked at this.</td>', 'I love the sharpness of the white lines that seperate the pieces, but I don''t care much for the blank spots. The little black spots are very distracting, not sure what those are, but I wish it were all one color. I''m certain that it was part of the puzzle, out of your control, but that''s the first thing I noticed when I looked at this.', '2009-02-27 11:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277761, 768002, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think this has so much potential, I love the idea and the framing. I wish the dof were a little more pronounced so the stripes wouldn''t stand out so much. Great lighting.</td>', 'I think this has so much potential, I love the idea and the framing. I wish the dof were a little more pronounced so the stripes wouldn''t stand out so much. Great lighting.', '2009-02-27 11:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277766, 767083, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting and certainly different than anything I''ve seen in this challenge yet. I give you points for bravery. I think that the vast whiteness might look a little more purposeful with a stronger color in the border - solid black, for instance, or a bright primary color.</td>', 'Interesting and certainly different than anything I''ve seen in this challenge yet. I give you points for bravery. I think that the vast whiteness might look a little more purposeful with a stronger color in the border - solid black, for instance, or a bright primary color.', '2009-02-27 11:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277768, 768172, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the saturated yellow in this. I wish the globe were completely included in the pic. I think this is fun to look at and different.</td>', 'I love the saturated yellow in this. I wish the globe were completely included in the pic. I think this is fun to look at and different.', '2009-02-27 11:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277769, 767770, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this, reminds me of the way light bounces off of shell jewelry. I normally find dark corners kind of distracting, and I do here as well in the upper left. Lovely, though. Relaxing.</td>', 'I love the colors in this, reminds me of the way light bounces off of shell jewelry. I normally find dark corners kind of distracting, and I do here as well in the upper left. Lovely, though. Relaxing.', '2009-02-27 11:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277772, 768128, 98141, '<td valign="top">I just learned what Bakugan is, I hadn''t heard of that one before. I like this picture, the composition and lighting, my only nit pick is that I wish the background were completely black, the subtle shapes there are a little distracting.</td>', 'I just learned what Bakugan is, I hadn''t heard of that one before. I like this picture, the composition and lighting, my only nit pick is that I wish the background were completely black, the subtle shapes there are a little distracting.', '2009-02-27 11:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277779, 766798, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think this might be too simple - by which I just mean that it doesn''t immediately strike one as photography. I think it appears to graphic to do well in a DPC challenge. I dig it though, he looks like a cowboy by the way his legs are bent. Wonder if he lost his horse?</td>', 'I think this might be too simple - by which I just mean that it doesn''t immediately strike one as photography. I think it appears to graphic to do well in a DPC challenge. I dig it though, he looks like a cowboy by the way his legs are bent. Wonder if he lost his horse?', '2009-02-27 11:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277781, 767785, 98141, '<td valign="top">Is she unable to chase him because she''s on house arrest? Her ankle looks very suspicious, haha. The white spot in the lower right is very bright and distracting to me, I don''t feel that it''s very sharp, and the composition is very dull.</td>', 'Is she unable to chase him because she''s on house arrest? Her ankle looks very suspicious, haha. The white spot in the lower right is very bright and distracting to me, I don''t feel that it''s very sharp, and the composition is very dull.', '2009-02-27 11:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277782, 767993, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ooh, shiny. I love shiny things. Great dof and I love the blue mixed in with the black and white and silver - all such cool colors that compliment each other well.</td>', 'Ooh, shiny. I love shiny things. Great dof and I love the blue mixed in with the black and white and silver - all such cool colors that compliment each other well.', '2009-02-27 11:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277785, 767951, 95579, '<td valign="top">Like the subliminal messages ; ) (probably the wrong word but you know what im getting at!)</td>', 'Like the subliminal messages ; ) (probably the wrong word but you know what im getting at!)', '2009-02-27 11:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277791, 766833, 103475, '<td valign="top">this is brunswick</td>', 'this is brunswick', '2009-02-27 11:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277836, 766832, 811, '<td valign="top">I looks like a person flexing their muscle to me!  The elbow is the point furthest to the left.</td>', 'I looks like a person flexing their muscle to me!  The elbow is the point furthest to the left.', '2009-02-27 12:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277921, 768155, 98141, '<td valign="top">Imho, this doesn''t fit the challenge very well... but as a photo, I don''t dislike it. I think it would be stronger without the edges outside the cup showing in the bottom corners. I did the color and shapes of the air in the liquid.</td>', 'Imho, this doesn''t fit the challenge very well... but as a photo, I don''t dislike it. I think it would be stronger without the edges outside the cup showing in the bottom corners. I did the color and shapes of the air in the liquid.', '2009-02-27 14:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277923, 767202, 98141, '<td valign="top">What can I say about this? I don''t think it really conveys any emotion or a story. I see a person/ghost staring at a school/building but it doesn''t really connect with me. I look at this and I don''t see longing or regret or anything really spooky and I wish for more.</td>', 'What can I say about this? I don''t think it really conveys any emotion or a story. I see a person/ghost staring at a school/building but it doesn''t really connect with me. I look at this and I don''t see longing or regret or anything really spooky and I wish for more.', '2009-02-27 14:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277924, 768135, 98141, '<td valign="top">I feel like I was standing in this exact spot last month while I was in Spain, but they have a lot of cathedrals that make me feel that way. They''re all so grand. I''m surprised you took out the color, I''ve always loved the way that those stained glass windows look, but it does add an eerie feeling to it.</td>', 'I feel like I was standing in this exact spot last month while I was in Spain, but they have a lot of cathedrals that make me feel that way. They''re all so grand. I''m surprised you took out the color, I''ve always loved the way that those stained glass windows look, but it does add an eerie feeling to it.', '2009-02-27 14:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277925, 768202, 98141, '<td valign="top">A little grainy and nothing seems to be in sharp focus... The subject is a little dull as well and nothing really interesting going on in this pic. Try using a different pov or less basic composition to make it pop a little more.</td>', 'A little grainy and nothing seems to be in sharp focus... The subject is a little dull as well and nothing really interesting going on in this pic. Try using a different pov or less basic composition to make it pop a little more.', '2009-02-27 14:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277926, 767660, 98141, '<td valign="top">For some reason, it freaks me out that his backbone looks like it''s on the front of his chest instead of in the back where it belongs... Everything in this photo looks so unnaturally creamy and smooth, I love it but it''s eerie at the same time.</td>', 'For some reason, it freaks me out that his backbone looks like it''s on the front of his chest instead of in the back where it belongs... Everything in this photo looks so unnaturally creamy and smooth, I love it but it''s eerie at the same time.', '2009-02-27 14:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277927, 768225, 98141, '<td valign="top">To me, this is cool, but it is lacking something. I think it''s how matte the reflection seems. There''s not much gleam to it. I miss that.</td>', 'To me, this is cool, but it is lacking something. I think it''s how matte the reflection seems. There''s not much gleam to it. I miss that.', '2009-02-27 14:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277928, 768109, 98141, '<td valign="top">Regardless of whether I agree that this belongs in the puzzle challenge or not, I like this picture. I love seeing the shadows of clouds on landscapes, I think it adds such a sense of depth.</td>', 'Regardless of whether I agree that this belongs in the puzzle challenge or not, I like this picture. I love seeing the shadows of clouds on landscapes, I think it adds such a sense of depth.', '2009-02-27 14:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277935, 768025, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the woodsy tones in this better than the cold tones from the spotlight. I think I''d like it better with warmer lighting. Just my $0.02.</td>', 'I like the woodsy tones in this better than the cold tones from the spotlight. I think I''d like it better with warmer lighting. Just my $0.02.', '2009-02-27 14:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277936, 768239, 98141, '<td valign="top">There''s something fluid about this that I like very much. I do wish that the in-focus bit were a little sharper. But overall, I dig it.</td>', 'There''s something fluid about this that I like very much. I do wish that the in-focus bit were a little sharper. But overall, I dig it.', '2009-02-27 14:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277937, 768157, 98141, '<td valign="top">Ah, I was wondering if I would see any of these!! I love the way the colors turned out, and they look fabulous against the black. Very nice.</td>', 'Ah, I was wondering if I would see any of these!! I love the way the colors turned out, and they look fabulous against the black. Very nice.', '2009-02-27 14:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277938, 768119, 98141, '<td valign="top">Another one that I think will get knocked down for seeming like a graphic rather than a photograph... I love the black pieces with the white in between, I think we see it the other way around more often. This is a bold image and I like it overall.</td>', 'Another one that I think will get knocked down for seeming like a graphic rather than a photograph... I love the black pieces with the white in between, I think we see it the other way around more often. This is a bold image and I like it overall.', '2009-02-27 14:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277940, 768130, 98141, '<td valign="top">Okay, I just don''t think this works... It''s got a very candid kind of feel, it''s not very sharp, it''s strange... Is she wearing only one sock? And why is she confused about being under a car? I guess I am puzzled, so that part worked out. As for the rest of it... I''m not so sure.</td>', 'Okay, I just don''t think this works... It''s got a very candid kind of feel, it''s not very sharp, it''s strange... Is she wearing only one sock? And why is she confused about being under a car? I guess I am puzzled, so that part worked out. As for the rest of it... I''m not so sure.', '2009-02-27 14:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277947, 768198, 56502, '<td valign="top">I like this creative idea.</td>', 'I like this creative idea.', '2009-02-27 14:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277948, 768146, 56502, '<td valign="top">Amazing, if not puzzling, architecture.</td>', 'Amazing, if not puzzling, architecture.', '2009-02-27 14:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277949, 768079, 56502, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot!', '2009-02-27 14:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277950, 767467, 56502, '<td valign="top">Funny idea (unless one objects to this kind of jokes ;-) ) and fitting expression.</td>', 'Funny idea (unless one objects to this kind of jokes ;-) ) and fitting expression.', '2009-02-27 14:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277951, 768042, 56502, '<td valign="top">I like the play of the shadows.</td>', 'I like the play of the shadows.', '2009-02-27 14:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277953, 767748, 56502, '<td valign="top">Her expression is priceless!</td>', 'Her expression is priceless!', '2009-02-27 14:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277954, 767903, 56502, '<td valign="top">There are several comparable shots in the challenge, but yours is the one I liked best of those.</td>', 'There are several comparable shots in the challenge, but yours is the one I liked best of those.', '2009-02-27 14:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277955, 767902, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love this portrait, I think it''s a beautiful pic of a lovely gal and the color of the cube really pops. Well done.</td>', 'I love this portrait, I think it''s a beautiful pic of a lovely gal and the color of the cube really pops. Well done.', '2009-02-27 14:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277959, 766604, 104327, '<td valign="top">++</td>', '++', '2009-02-27 15:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277969, 767960, 98141, '<td valign="top">Whoa, now that is some contorting.I wish the dock weren''t in the lower right, but I love the subject.</td>', 'Whoa, now that is some contorting.I wish the dock weren''t in the lower right, but I love the subject.', '2009-02-27 15:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277970, 766793, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, has a feeling of motion and speed, but stillness as well. Nice dof and colors.</td>', 'I like this a lot, has a feeling of motion and speed, but stillness as well. Nice dof and colors.', '2009-02-27 15:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277971, 768257, 98141, '<td valign="top">This feels a bit grainy to me, and I think the composition would be better without the birds right in the middle of the shot. I like the way the shadows are behind them.</td>', 'This feels a bit grainy to me, and I think the composition would be better without the birds right in the middle of the shot. I like the way the shadows are behind them.', '2009-02-27 15:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277972, 768079, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. The clouds, the water, the color of the chair, the clothes... everything flows together. What can I say except absolutely stunning?</td>', 'This is beautiful. The clouds, the water, the color of the chair, the clothes... everything flows together. What can I say except absolutely stunning?', '2009-02-27 15:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278000, 768135, 57447, '<td valign="top">Architectural puzzle too! I like this shot.</td>', 'Architectural puzzle too! I like this shot.', '2009-02-27 15:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278001, 766604, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of how the tree is right in the middle of the pic and grabs so much attention from the subtle subject of the photo, the person/ghost. It''s a cool effect, bt I think the thunder is stolen by the distracting tree.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of how the tree is right in the middle of the pic and grabs so much attention from the subtle subject of the photo, the person/ghost. It''s a cool effect, bt I think the thunder is stolen by the distracting tree.', '2009-02-27 15:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278005, 766947, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the angle and the composition here. Great colors, too. The edge around the money seems to have a strange dark blue tint to it though and I''m not sure why that is.</td>', 'I love the angle and the composition here. Great colors, too. The edge around the money seems to have a strange dark blue tint to it though and I''m not sure why that is.', '2009-02-27 15:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278006, 768212, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice dof, good clarity on the crossword.</td>', 'Nice dof, good clarity on the crossword.', '2009-02-27 15:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278007, 767577, 98141, '<td valign="top">Is is strange because it''s on the ground? I thin that including a little more space for comparison would make that more clear. Also, a shallower dof would be nice since the strip mall behind it is a little distracting.</td>', 'Is is strange because it''s on the ground? I thin that including a little more space for comparison would make that more clear. Also, a shallower dof would be nice since the strip mall behind it is a little distracting.', '2009-02-27 16:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278008, 767700, 98141, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, great title, great shot, I like the abstractness of it even though it''s clear what we''re lookign at. Nice colors.</td>', 'Hahaha, great title, great shot, I like the abstractness of it even though it''s clear what we''re lookign at. Nice colors.', '2009-02-27 16:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278009, 766795, 98141, '<td valign="top">Creepy! Cool idea, I love the lighting, the shadows look great and really add to the feeling of the photo.</td>', 'Creepy! Cool idea, I love the lighting, the shadows look great and really add to the feeling of the photo.', '2009-02-27 16:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278010, 768246, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, cool idea, I''m going to say I''d like it more with a square frame, but I''m partial to that. I like the fuzzy edges of the shape, gies it depth.</td>', 'Nice shot, cool idea, I''m going to say I''d like it more with a square frame, but I''m partial to that. I like the fuzzy edges of the shape, gies it depth.', '2009-02-27 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
