(5278015, 767735, 98141, '<td valign="top">I find it strange how he seems to be perfectly vertical but the sign and seat in front of im seem so tilted... it''s weirding me out a little. The colors remind me of the Twilight Zone for some reason. I find this photo eerie but cool.</td>', 'I find it strange how he seems to be perfectly vertical but the sign and seat in front of im seem so tilted... it''s weirding me out a little. The colors remind me of the Twilight Zone for some reason. I find this photo eerie but cool.', '2009-02-27 16:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
