(5279482, 768003, 98141, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail does not do any justice to this photo. It looks so dull, and then you open it up and I just couldn''t help my visceral reaction to it. It reminds me of ooze or slime, even though I know it''s consistency isn''t actually like that. I like that I had an involuntary reaction to it. Good job.</td>', 'The thumbnail does not do any justice to this photo. It looks so dull, and then you open it up and I just couldn''t help my visceral reaction to it. It reminds me of ooze or slime, even though I know it''s consistency isn''t actually like that. I like that I had an involuntary reaction to it. Good job.', '2009-02-28 17:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5279483, 768059, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is very grainy to me. More clarity would do a lot for this. Also, I''m not convinced that this fits into this challenge theme. Without the title, it certainly wouldn''t imho.</td>', 'This is very grainy to me. More clarity would do a lot for this. Also, I''m not convinced that this fits into this challenge theme. Without the title, it certainly wouldn''t imho.', '2009-02-28 17:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
