(5279514, 766605, 98141, '<td valign="top">I am starting to wonder if those things come apart really easily, because it always seemed to me that it would be hard to do. Nice dof, nice colors.</td>', 'I am starting to wonder if those things come apart really easily, because it always seemed to me that it would be hard to do. Nice dof, nice colors.', '2009-02-28 17:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5279515, 767785, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like a midday sun shot. That''s usually the hardest light to get a good shot in. I''m afraid this comes off a little flat to me. I popped it into PSP to see, and found and some curves, saturation and clarify gave it quite a bit more pop. The composition is a little static to me as well. Maybe some alternate cropping to get it to flow a bit differently could bump it up a bit.</td>', 'Looks like a midday sun shot. That''s usually the hardest light to get a good shot in. I''m afraid this comes off a little flat to me. I popped it into PSP to see, and found and some curves, saturation and clarify gave it quite a bit more pop. The composition is a little static to me as well. Maybe some alternate cropping to get it to flow a bit differently could bump it up a bit.', '2009-02-28 17:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5279519, 767035, 83313, '<td valign="top">You caught some light that makes this look almost like an illustration. It''s an interesting form.</td>', 'You caught some light that makes this look almost like an illustration. It''s an interesting form.', '2009-02-28 17:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
