(5279564, 768200, 83313, '<td valign="top">What the heck izzit? There''s a little bit of fuzziness to some of the edges and gray areas. At only 60k in size, you had a lot more overhead for reducing compression and you may have been able to get some more smoothness out of this by using less JPEG compression. That said, it''s still an interesting shot and worthy of a decent vote.</td>', 'What the heck izzit? There''s a little bit of fuzziness to some of the edges and gray areas. At only 60k in size, you had a lot more overhead for reducing compression and you may have been able to get some more smoothness out of this by using less JPEG compression. That said, it''s still an interesting shot and worthy of a decent vote.', '2009-02-28 17:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
