(5279856, 766655, 102505, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of one of those puzzles in Myst that would frustrate me to no end.<br/>I love it.</td>', 'Reminds me of one of those puzzles in Myst that would frustrate me to no end.I love it.', '2009-02-28 22:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5279864, 767208, 102505, '<td valign="top">I feel like the contrast is just a BIT much. Otherwise I really enjoy the composition and the puzzle.</td>', 'I feel like the contrast is just a BIT much. Otherwise I really enjoy the composition and the puzzle.', '2009-02-28 22:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5279873, 768009, 102505, '<td valign="top">Seems to lack a certain vibrance. But the contrast and colors are good, methinks a better lighting setup would have truly complimented this great photo.</td>', 'Seems to lack a certain vibrance. But the contrast and colors are good, methinks a better lighting setup would have truly complimented this great photo.', '2009-02-28 22:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280630, 768186, 23098, '<td valign="top">Good one!</td>', 'Good one!', '2009-03-01 09:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280725, 767528, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is kind of cool, very geometric. I think it would be neat in b&amp;w as well. I also think it''s kind of basic, no wow factor that really makes it stand out from the crowd.</td>', 'This is kind of cool, very geometric. I think it would be neat in b&w as well. I also think it''s kind of basic, no wow factor that really makes it stand out from the crowd.', '2009-03-01 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280729, 767761, 98141, '<td valign="top">The thing that I find very distracting in this is the log on the floor. I think I''d like this more without that. I like the colors a lot.</td>', 'The thing that I find very distracting in this is the log on the floor. I think I''d like this more without that. I like the colors a lot.', '2009-03-01 10:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280732, 767150, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great focus, I like this portrait a lot. Nice lighting and composition. Creative idea. Great job.</td>', 'Great focus, I like this portrait a lot. Nice lighting and composition. Creative idea. Great job.', '2009-03-01 10:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280736, 767808, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is a cool pic, I love the exposure on it, adds to the "magical" feeling.</td>', 'This is a cool pic, I love the exposure on it, adds to the "magical" feeling.', '2009-03-01 10:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280739, 768253, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think the contrast could go up a bit and I think the exposure could go down a bit.</td>', 'I think the contrast could go up a bit and I think the exposure could go down a bit.', '2009-03-01 10:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280740, 768120, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great texture to the stones, smooth and creamy but rough at the same time. Nice shot.</td>', 'Great texture to the stones, smooth and creamy but rough at the same time. Nice shot.', '2009-03-01 10:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280743, 768009, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is a little dark. Also, the napkin is distracting. A plain, smooth surface would have worked better I think.</td>', 'This is a little dark. Also, the napkin is distracting. A plain, smooth surface would have worked better I think.', '2009-03-01 10:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280746, 767664, 98141, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this, I just wish I could see it better, it''s a little bit too dark for me, especially along the bottom and sides.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this, I just wish I could see it better, it''s a little bit too dark for me, especially along the bottom and sides.', '2009-03-01 10:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280747, 767352, 98141, '<td valign="top">I wish the paper weren''t cut off on the left side, but the colors really pop and I''m always a fan of popping colors.</td>', 'I wish the paper weren''t cut off on the left side, but the colors really pop and I''m always a fan of popping colors.', '2009-03-01 10:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280750, 768264, 98141, '<td valign="top">This feels a little messy to me. I think this must be ice or something, but I get the feeling that I''m looking out at the world through a dirty plastic bag. I think it would work better if the color were cleaner and with ice (or whatever it is) that hadn''t so many bubbles and dirt in there.</td>', 'This feels a little messy to me. I think this must be ice or something, but I get the feeling that I''m looking out at the world through a dirty plastic bag. I think it would work better if the color were cleaner and with ice (or whatever it is) that hadn''t so many bubbles and dirt in there.', '2009-03-01 10:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5280752, 768271, 98141, '<td valign="top">To me, everything here blends together. All the colors are so neutral and the dof doesn''t make the subject stand out from the background.</td>', 'To me, everything here blends together. All the colors are so neutral and the dof doesn''t make the subject stand out from the background.', '2009-03-01 10:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
