(5281342, 768143, 101730, '<td valign="top">Nice framing of the person and an original vantage point. I also like the look on her face: that somewhat hopeful look when you think you''ve found a piece that fits just before you find out it doesn''t (or does of course).</td>', 'Nice framing of the person and an original vantage point. I also like the look on her face: that somewhat hopeful look when you think you''ve found a piece that fits just before you find out it doesn''t (or does of course).', '2009-03-01 15:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
