(5283002, 768110, 30364, '<td valign="top">Even after the desensitizing effect of all the banal jigsaw puzzle entries, this one still manages to shine through as having some substance. Probably because it actually <i>is</i> a puzzle and thus invites some thought.   What a welcome relief.  7.</td>', 'Even after the desensitizing effect of all the banal jigsaw puzzle entries, this one still manages to shine through as having some substance. Probably because it actually is a puzzle and thus invites some thought.   What a welcome relief.  7.', '2009-03-02 07:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283003, 767218, 30364, '<td valign="top">I always like photographs where part of the picture is outside the frame.  Can there really be a hoop up there, in the street?  Or another guy a few yards out of shot? Or just a wall, and this is a solo game of dreams?  The other two men are indifferent ... city life, I guess.  And one other puzzle: what the hell is a cheese steak?  Sounds revolting.  <br/> <br/>Unfinished photography; it''s the best kind.  7.</td>', 'I always like photographs where part of the picture is outside the frame.  Can there really be a hoop up there, in the street?  Or another guy a few yards out of shot? Or just a wall, and this is a solo game of dreams?  The other two men are indifferent ... city life, I guess.  And one other puzzle: what the hell is a cheese steak?  Sounds revolting.   Unfinished photography; it''s the best kind.  7.', '2009-03-02 07:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5283398, 767737, 103268, '<td valign="top">I laughed when I saw this. He almost looks like Einstien as well.</td>', 'I laughed when I saw this. He almost looks like Einstien as well.', '2009-03-02 10:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
