(5287298, 768079, 18655, '<td valign="top">I was absolutely certain this would win and voted it 10 myself. I''m very disappointed to see this on 20th place.<br/>Clearly you received a bunch of 1,2,3 and 4''s (33 to be exact!!) since users couldn''t see the puzzle in it. It was without a doubt puzzling to me why anyone (especially a gorgeous hottie!) would want to sit in the water on a chair half under, in a partly submerged evening dress, sipping tea...<br/>The water may be a little murky but you made up for it with perfect "Simpson''s" clouds, exellent pose and a very well executed shot over all.<br/> <br/>ETA: If this shows up in your next book, I''ll have to buy a copy! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-04 06:08:54.</i></td>', 'I was absolutely certain this would win and voted it 10 myself. I''m very disappointed to see this on 20th place.Clearly you received a bunch of 1,2,3 and 4''s (33 to be exact!!) since users couldn''t see the puzzle in it. It was without a doubt puzzling to me why anyone (especially a gorgeous hottie!) would want to sit in the water on a chair half under, in a partly submerged evening dress, sipping tea...The water may be a little murky but you made up for it with perfect "Simpson''s" clouds, exellent pose and a very well executed shot over all. ETA: If this shows up in your next book, I''ll have to buy a copy! :)', '2009-03-04 04:26:18.000000', '2009-03-04 06:08:54.000000', 0),
