(5287426, 767467, 20748, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by smudgeSMJ:</b></div><hr/><i> Simple and funny and an interesting take on the challenge, but this lacks the x-factor. The composition is too straightforward for me and the background is too dull - the stark whiteness of the thought bubble kind of makes the wall seem dirty to me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The thought bubbles are white and supposed to be photographed as such, the wall is "seafoam green" and is recorded by my camera at that color. Clean your monitor. The composition is supposed to be straightforward. There''s no mystery here, keep that x-factor blasphemy off DPC, this isn''t 1X.com...</td>', 'Originally posted by smudgeSMJ: Simple and funny and an interesting take on the challenge, but this lacks the x-factor. The composition is too straightforward for me and the background is too dull - the stark whiteness of the thought bubble kind of makes the wall seem dirty to me.   The thought bubbles are white and supposed to be photographed as such, the wall is "seafoam green" and is recorded by my camera at that color. Clean your monitor. The composition is supposed to be straightforward. There''s no mystery here, keep that x-factor blasphemy off DPC, this isn''t 1X.com...', '2009-03-04 07:32:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5287437, 767888, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well executed.  Congrats on the top 10 finish!</td>', 'Great idea and well executed.  Congrats on the top 10 finish!', '2009-03-04 07:43:54.000000', NULL, 0),
