(5288490, 767095, 95579, '<td valign="top">I didnt vote on yours but I can see how it could have scored low as I probably would have given it a shoehorn score.<br/>The shot itself is technically fine from my point of view. colours are good, dof is good &amp; the border is nice.<br/>For the challenge though its not a great fit as far as im concerned as it does look like a good shot that you took and decided to enter it in the challenge.<br/>Hope that helps!<br/>Dont give up entering!!</td>', 'I didnt vote on yours but I can see how it could have scored low as I probably would have given it a shoehorn score.The shot itself is technically fine from my point of view. colours are good, dof is good & the border is nice.For the challenge though its not a great fit as far as im concerned as it does look like a good shot that you took and decided to enter it in the challenge.Hope that helps!Dont give up entering!!', '2009-03-04 12:16:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5288502, 767083, 88580, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by morganeddington502:</b></div><hr/><i> no </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hmmm.  I''m not sure what to make of this....<br/> <br/>This user registered March 2 and left his first (and only) comment on my image the same day.<br/> <br/>All the bright white must''ve scared him off.  lol</td>', 'Originally posted by morganeddington502: no   Hmmm.  I''m not sure what to make of this.... This user registered March 2 and left his first (and only) comment on my image the same day. All the bright white must''ve scared him off.  lol', '2009-03-04 12:23:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5288503, 767095, 100495, '<td valign="top">I also thought it was a bit of a shoehorn, and only really worked because of the title. I don''t find it puzzling.<br/> <br/>However, it has great selective focus and exposure and the colours are vivid.  The border detracts rather than adds.</td>', 'I also thought it was a bit of a shoehorn, and only really worked because of the title. I don''t find it puzzling. However, it has great selective focus and exposure and the colours are vivid.  The border detracts rather than adds.', '2009-03-04 12:23:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5288508, 767095, 61961, '<td valign="top">Flowers are such a common subject that any but the most outstanding shots are bound to gather average-or-below votes at best.  This seems like a fairly standard photo to me, even with the shallow DOF.  I rarely like "eyedropper" color borders, so that''s another negative.  I didn''t vote on this but would probably have given it a 5 or 4.  FYI, I don''t give much weight to captions (titles), but I "got" the puzzling idea without it.</td>', 'Flowers are such a common subject that any but the most outstanding shots are bound to gather average-or-below votes at best.  This seems like a fairly standard photo to me, even with the shallow DOF.  I rarely like "eyedropper" color borders, so that''s another negative.  I didn''t vote on this but would probably have given it a 5 or 4.  FYI, I don''t give much weight to captions (titles), but I "got" the puzzling idea without it.', '2009-03-04 12:27:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5288523, 767095, 83313, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 5. I understood what you were pointing out, and though it was slightly puzzling, it was not a serious curiosity for me. Mostly, though, I found it an average floral shot. Nothing really seemed to stand out from it. Perhaps the yellow flowers had too much green cast to really stand out. There was not a lot of detail coming through either. A closer shot, showing off the details of that one flower might have had more impact on me. Also, I am not a huge fan of floral shots, so ti has to be really well done to grab my attention. I''m not a big fan of square crops either. I only do them on my own shots when it is the only composition that works for an image.</td>', 'I gave it a 5. I understood what you were pointing out, and though it was slightly puzzling, it was not a serious curiosity for me. Mostly, though, I found it an average floral shot. Nothing really seemed to stand out from it. Perhaps the yellow flowers had too much green cast to really stand out. There was not a lot of detail coming through either. A closer shot, showing off the details of that one flower might have had more impact on me. Also, I am not a huge fan of floral shots, so ti has to be really well done to grab my attention. I''m not a big fan of square crops either. I only do them on my own shots when it is the only composition that works for an image.', '2009-03-04 12:35:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5288575, 768120, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful, I love everything about it. Huge congrats on winning.</td>', 'This is so beautiful, I love everything about it. Huge congrats on winning.', '2009-03-04 13:01:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5288583, 768186, 52549, '<td valign="top">This shot is just soooo cool. I''m glad the work you put into it paid off. Congrats on your ribbon, Nicole.</td>', 'This shot is just soooo cool. I''m glad the work you put into it paid off. Congrats on your ribbon, Nicole.', '2009-03-04 13:02:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5288587, 766754, 52549, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! Great shot. Big congrats on your ribbon and new PB, Peter.</td>', 'Brilliant! Great shot. Big congrats on your ribbon and new PB, Peter.', '2009-03-04 13:03:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5288597, 767498, 52549, '<td valign="top">Glad this did well, I think it''s fantastic! Congrats on the HM, Doug.</td>', 'Glad this did well, I think it''s fantastic! Congrats on the HM, Doug.', '2009-03-04 13:06:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5288601, 768114, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great idea, very creative. Congrats on 7th place, Are.</td>', 'Great idea, very creative. Congrats on 7th place, Are.', '2009-03-04 13:07:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5288739, 767095, 83686, '<td valign="top">It''s been awhile since I have commented or critiqued anyone''s photo but here are a few ideas. The lighting seems a bit harsh and there are some serious shadows on the flowers which distract the eye. Perhaps pushing down the flowers/weeds that casted the shadows would have been a corrective measure for that. The border is distracting, too bright and once again grabs the attention of your eye. Tighter crop on the two flowers at 8X10 would have shown more detail but the DoF might not have been as good. I find that not spelling out the idea of your shot in the title helps the observer come to their own conclusions. If your photo doesn''t say what the challenge asks for then you will pay for it in votes....and lately I see more critics scoring lower than ever. Anyway, this is my opinion and it''s not professional at all. Please feel free to check my portfolio and critique me anytime, I need it too.</td>', 'It''s been awhile since I have commented or critiqued anyone''s photo but here are a few ideas. The lighting seems a bit harsh and there are some serious shadows on the flowers which distract the eye. Perhaps pushing down the flowers/weeds that casted the shadows would have been a corrective measure for that. The border is distracting, too bright and once again grabs the attention of your eye. Tighter crop on the two flowers at 8X10 would have shown more detail but the DoF might not have been as good. I find that not spelling out the idea of your shot in the title helps the observer come to their own conclusions. If your photo doesn''t say what the challenge asks for then you will pay for it in votes....and lately I see more critics scoring lower than ever. Anyway, this is my opinion and it''s not professional at all. Please feel free to check my portfolio and critique me anytime, I need it too.', '2009-03-04 13:47:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5288770, 768002, 68504, '<td valign="top">This just rises to the top with the greatest of ease.</td>', 'This just rises to the top with the greatest of ease.', '2009-03-04 14:03:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5288886, 768120, 39825, '<td valign="top">oh wow - BEAUTIFUL!!!! congrats on the well deserved ribbon. great colours, love it.</td>', 'oh wow - BEAUTIFUL!!!! congrats on the well deserved ribbon. great colours, love it.', '2009-03-04 14:53:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5289027, 768018, 27133, '<td valign="top">Don''t worry girl....I entered a shot that is puzzling....very obviously puzzling...and many couldn''t see the puzzling part in it....you just can''t win these days...lmao!  For what it is worth...I like your shot...beautiful work with the reflections.</td>', 'Don''t worry girl....I entered a shot that is puzzling....very obviously puzzling...and many couldn''t see the puzzling part in it....you just can''t win these days...lmao!  For what it is worth...I like your shot...beautiful work with the reflections.', '2009-03-04 15:32:25.000000', NULL, 0),
