(5289255, 766754, 37845, '<td valign="top">You and Ernie are setting a high standard for the Snowmen.... we have to ribbon every week now :D</td>', 'You and Ernie are setting a high standard for the Snowmen.... we have to ribbon every week now :D', '2009-03-04 17:01:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5289301, 767095, 327, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=102315" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">cytoxan</a> Your a good sport and you''ll see things will get better with each challenge you enter. You begin to figure out what works here and what doesn''t. It does NOT mean your shot is not good. Your flowers printed, framed and hung on a wall would be very pretty. Keep your good attitude and keep shooting.</td>', ' cytoxan Your a good sport and you''ll see things will get better with each challenge you enter. You begin to figure out what works here and what doesn''t. It does NOT mean your shot is not good. Your flowers printed, framed and hung on a wall would be very pretty. Keep your good attitude and keep shooting.', '2009-03-04 17:19:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5289325, 768186, 86447, '<td valign="top">Congrats again!   Genius piece of work!<br/> <br/>You might want to "Edit the details of this Image" above and repeat your steps.  I''m sure many people have been here to see how you did it, and most will miss it in the comments section because usually that''s other people talking to you about the image.<br/> <br/>Congrats on a masterpiece!</td>', 'Congrats again!   Genius piece of work! You might want to "Edit the details of this Image" above and repeat your steps.  I''m sure many people have been here to see how you did it, and most will miss it in the comments section because usually that''s other people talking to you about the image. Congrats on a masterpiece!', '2009-03-04 17:30:51.000000', NULL, 0),
